    {
      "source": "Default implementation of a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a> for MongoDB using <a href=\"BasicMongoPersistentEntity.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>BasicMongoPersistentEntity</code></a> and\n<a href=\"BasicMongoPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>BasicMongoPersistentProperty</code></a> as primary abstractions.",
      "translation": "使用 <a href=\"BasicMongoPersistentEntity.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>BasicMongoPersistentEntity</code></a> 和 <a href=\"BasicMongoPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>BasicMongoPersistentProperty</code></a> 作为主要抽象，为 MongoDB 提供的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a> 的默认实现。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Configures the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/model/FieldNamingStrategy.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>FieldNamingStrategy</code></a> to be used to determine the field name if no manual mapping is applied.",
      "translation": "配置 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/model/FieldNamingStrategy.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>FieldNamingStrategy</code></a>，用于在应用手动映射时确定字段名称。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Configures the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/model/FieldNamingStrategy.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>FieldNamingStrategy</code></a> to be used to determine the field name if no manual mapping is applied.\nDefaults to a strategy using the plain property name.",
      "translation": "配置 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/model/FieldNamingStrategy.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>FieldNamingStrategy</code></a>，用于在应用手动映射时确定字段名称。默认采用使用简单属性名的策略。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether auto-index creation is enabled or disabled. <br/>\n<strong>NOTE:</strong> Index creation should happen at a well-defined time that is ideally controlled by the\napplication itself.",
